WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.170
George hated worms.

2
00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:11.471
He didn't like to touch them.

3
00:00:12.191 --> 00:00:13.872
He didn't even like to look at them.

4
00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:18.793
"Yikes! It's a worm.

5
00:00:19.513 --> 00:00:22.334
I hate worms," screamed George.

6
00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:25.075
"What? You hate me?

7
00:00:25.915 --> 00:00:28.295
Do you also hate those pretty flowers?"

8
00:00:29.016 --> 00:00:29.916
asked the earthworm.

9
00:00:33.148 --> 00:00:36.009
"No, I like them," said George.

10
00:00:36.029 --> 00:00:39.771
"Well, then, you must like me too.

11
00:00:40.551 --> 00:00:43.352
I help all of those grow," said the worm.

12
00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:49.255
George had never seen a talking earthworm.

13
00:00:50.195 --> 00:00:52.176
But he still didn't like worms.

14
00:00:53.377 --> 00:00:55.077
"I am a great digger.

15
00:00:55.778 --> 00:01:00.960
I dig holes that help air and water get into the ground," said the worm.

16
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.401
"Plants need a lot of air and water to grow.

17
00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:11.742
Without me the plants could not grow," said the worm with pride.

18
00:01:12.763 --> 00:01:15.444
But George still didn't like worms.

19
00:01:16.244 --> 00:01:21.025
"I also make food for the plants," said the worm.

20
00:01:21.045 --> 00:01:23.426
"Really? How?"

21
00:01:23.866 --> 00:01:24.586
asked George.

22
00:01:24.606 --> 00:01:30.948
"I eat soil that is filled with small bits of plants and bacteria.

23
00:01:31.788 --> 00:01:36.492
They go through my body and out the other end," said the worm.

24
00:01:36.512 --> 00:01:40.055
"Plants eat your poo?"

25
00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:41.736
asked George with a laugh.

26
00:01:41.756 --> 00:01:45.479
"That's right!

27
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.842
It is called fertilizer," said the worm.

28
00:01:48.862 --> 00:01:51.664
"But you are so small.

29
00:01:52.465 --> 00:01:54.507
How can one little worm help?"

30
00:01:54.987 --> 00:01:55.708
asked George.

31
00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:01.738
George did not know that the earthworm was not alone.

32
00:02:02.978 --> 00:02:08.220
Even in George's small garden, there were more than five hundred earthworms.

33
00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:13.482
"All my friends work together to help your garden," said the worm.

34
00:02:18.184 --> 00:02:19.445
do you still hate me?"

35
00:02:20.425 --> 00:02:27.288
In a shy voice, George said, "No, but you are very dirty and yucky."

36
00:02:28.456 --> 00:02:29.397
"I'm not dirty.

37
00:02:29.417 --> 00:02:31.359
I am very clean.

38
00:02:32.059 --> 00:02:32.560
Feel me!"

39
00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:33.641
said the worm.

40
00:02:38.645 --> 00:02:41.187
I don't know," George said quietly.

41
00:02:41.207 --> 00:02:42.888
"Come on!"

42
00:02:43.689 --> 00:02:45.731
George carefully touched the worm.

43
00:02:45.751 --> 00:02:49.574
"See! I'm not so bad," said the worm.

44
00:02:53.497 --> 00:02:56.360
you are kind of soft," admitted George.

45
00:02:57.552 --> 00:03:00.014
Now George was beginning to like the worm.

46
00:03:00.034 --> 00:03:05.077
"But, Worm, you don't have any bones," said George.

47
00:03:05.097 --> 00:03:08.560
"That's right!

48
00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.921
I don't have arms or legs.

49
00:03:11.622 --> 00:03:13.743
I don't need them," explained the worm.

50
00:03:13.763 --> 00:03:15.704
"You don't need them?

51
00:03:16.505 --> 00:03:17.686
How do you move?"

52
00:03:18.186 --> 00:03:18.907
asked George.

53
00:03:18.927 --> 00:03:23.270
"I have muscles that go all around my body.

54
00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.412
I use them to push through the ground.

55
00:03:26.996 --> 00:03:39.560
Watch!" must take a long time for you to go anywhere," George said with a laugh.

56
00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.500
"That's true.

57
00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:46.882
I am a very slow mover, but I like it here in your garden.

58
00:03:47.442 --> 00:03:50.983
So I don't want to go very far," said the worm.

59
00:03:55.344 --> 00:03:57.246
I am glad you are in my garden.

60
00:03:58.146 --> 00:04:01.549
You are a great helper," said George with a smile.

61
00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:06.472
"Remember, worms are your friends," said the worm.

62
00:04:06.492 --> 00:04:08.194
"I will!"

63
00:04:08.634 --> 00:04:09.355
said George.
